cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "如果使用了解语，请引用它。If you use Jieyu, please cite it."
title: "解语 (Jieyu)"
abstract: >-
  解语是面向濒危语言田野记录的本地优先软件：录音、转写、标注、词典、语料库与导出。
  作者白军伟（Bai Junwei），北京师范大学。
  Jieyu is local-first software for endangered-language documentation,
  from recording through transcription, annotation, lexicon, corpus, and export.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Junwei
    family-names: Bai
    alias: Abe-Junwei
    affiliation: Beijing Normal University
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-04-24
license: ISC
url: https://github.com/Abe-Junwei/Jieyu
repository-code: https://github.com/Abe-Junwei/Jieyu
keywords:
  - endangered languages
  - field linguistics
  - transcription
  - lexicon
  - local-first
